    "title": "ASU-Beebe hosts free community pottery maker days",
    "text": "9 hours ago ASU-Beebe will host free community pottery maker sessions on Wednesday, Oct. 14 and Monday, Oct. 19 from 2–4 p.m. at the England Center Pottery Studio on the Beebe Campus , 201 North Orange Street . Community members can help make pottery that will later be sold to raise money for the student Emergency Hope Fund , which supports students in unexpected times of need. Donations to the fund can also be made online: https://www.asub.edu/donate\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by ASU-Beebe\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
